# Feature Architecture

## Layout

`app/Features/{Feature}/` → `Actions/`, `Services/`, `Http/{Controllers,Requests,Resources}/`, `Models/`, `Enums/`, `Policies/`, `Jobs/`

`app/Core/` — tenancy, pagination, cache, shared middleware. **Core never imports Features.**

## Layers (downward only)

HTTP → Application (Actions/Services) → Domain (Models/Enums/Policies) → Infrastructure (Jobs)

- Controllers: validate via Form Request, delegate to Action/Service, return API Resource.
- **No** business rules, `DB::table()`, plan limits, or invoice math in controllers.

## Naming

`StoreProjectRequest` · `CreateClientAction` · `ClientInvoiceService` · `ProjectStatus` enum · `final` classes · `declare(strict_types=1);`

## Module imports (mandatory)

| Feature | May import | Must NOT |
|---------|------------|----------|
| Auth | Core | other Features |
| Tenancy | Auth, Core | Delivery, Billing |
| Delivery | Tenancy, Core | ClientBilling, PlatformBilling |
| ClientBilling | Delivery, Tenancy, Core | PlatformBilling |
| PlatformBilling | Tenancy, Core | ClientBilling, Delivery |

## API versioning (folders)

| Versioned | Not versioned |
|-----------|---------------|
| `routes/features/v1/{feature}.php` | `app/Features/{Feature}/` — no `V1/` subfolder |
| `/api/v1` URL prefix | `database/`, `tests/Feature/{Feature}/` |

New endpoint: route file in `routes/features/v1/` → controller in `app/Features/{Feature}/Http/Controllers/`.

Factories/seeders: `database/factories/{Feature}/`, `database/seeders/`.
